{"seq":2,"slug":"philosophy-of-science","title":"科学哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学哲学-追问科学知识的本质与边界\">科学哲学：追问科学知识的本质与边界</h1><h2 id=\"定位与边界\">定位与边界</h2><p>科学哲学探究科学知识的本质、方法和局限性，追问&quot;什么使得科学成为科学&quot;这一根本问题。它不是科学本身，而是对科学活动的哲学反思——分析科学方法的逻辑结构、理论的内在构成、知识演进的模式以及科学与现实的关系。在哲学与逻辑类目中，「形式逻辑」提供科学推理所依赖的形式化工具，「认识论」讨论知识的一般性质，「技术哲学」关注科学知识的应用产物——本 hub 则聚焦科学理论与方法论本身，提供跨学科通用的科学哲学框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 共四章，从方法论到理论结构再到历史动态和本体论争论层层深入：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 科学方法论</strong>——从科学探究的基本方法入手：假说-演绎法、归纳与证伪、溯因推理、科学解释的模型。理解科学发现和验证的逻辑结构。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 理论结构</strong>——分析科学理论的内在构成：理论术语的意义、模型与表征的关系、理论还原的可能性、科学定律的本质。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 科学革命</strong>——探讨科学知识的历史演变模式：库恩的范式理论、拉卡托斯的研究纲领方法论、费耶阿本德的多元主义、科学进步的衡量标准。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 科学实在论</strong>——深入分析科学理论与现实的关系：实在论与反实在论之争、欠确定性论题、结构实在论、社会建构主义。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序学习。方法论和理论结构建立分析框架，科学革命提供历史动态视角，科学实在论引导对知识本身的深层反思。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>无需哲学专业背景。建议对以下内容有基本了解：科学与伪科学的直觉区分、归纳与演绎的基本区别、至少一门自然科学的基本训练经历（便于结合具体例子理解哲学论证）。如果对逻辑基础概念陌生，可先浏览「形式逻辑」hub 的第一章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../epistemology/\">认识论</a>——知识的一般性质、来源与辩护条件</li>\n<li><a href=\"../formal-logic/\">形式逻辑</a>——科学推理所依赖的逻辑基础工具</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-methodology","title":"科学方法论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hypothetico-deductive","title":"假说-演绎方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-methodology/hypothetico-deductive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"induction-and-falsification","title":"归纳与证伪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-methodology/induction-and-falsification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"abduction","title":"溯因推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-methodology/abduction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scientific-explanation","title":"科学解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-methodology/scientific-explanation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"theory-structure","title":"理论结构","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/theory-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-terms","title":"理论术语与观察术语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/theory-structure/theoretical-terms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"models-and-representation","title":"模型与表征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/theory-structure/models-and-representation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory-reduction","title":"理论还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/theory-structure/theory-reduction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scientific-laws","title":"科学定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/theory-structure/scientific-laws"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-revolutions","title":"科学革命","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kuhn-paradigm","title":"库恩的范式理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions/kuhn-paradigm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lakatos-research-programmes","title":"拉卡托斯的研究纲领方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions/lakatos-research-programmes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feyerabend-pluralism","title":"费耶阿本德的方法论多元主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions/feyerabend-pluralism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"scientific-progress","title":"科学进步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-revolutions/scientific-progress"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"scientific-realism","title":"科学实在论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realism-vs-antirealism","title":"实在论与反实在论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism/realism-vs-antirealism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"underdetermination","title":"欠定性论题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism/underdetermination"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-realism","title":"结构实在论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism/structural-realism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"social-constructivism","title":"社会建构主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-science/scientific-realism/social-constructivism"}]}]}